  displayName: Sleep Spell
  description: This spell puts any one monster into a deep sleep. The monster cannot
    move, attack, or defend itself. The monster may break the spell immediately or
    on a future turn by rolling 1 red die for each of its Mind points. If a 6 is
    rolled, the spell is broken. This spell does not affect mummies, zombies, or
    skeletons.
